Now the helper:

```rust
/// Render a surprise file path with its scored-universe rank appended, e.g.
/// `src/watch.rs (rank #12)`. When the rank is unknown (file not in the scored
/// universe), returns the plain path so consumers that exact-match paths keep
/// working. The rank is 1-based (rank 1 = most risky), matching the replay
/// path's `compute_validation` convention.
fn surprise_with_rank(file: &str, rank: Option<usize>) -> String {
    match rank {
        Some(r) => format!("{file} (rank #{r})"),
        None => file.to_string(),
    }
}
```

